-E36n7Jnm71B7OM&at_iframe=1#shop-knives\"><em>Shop Knives</em></a><em> to explore individual pieces, or choose </em><a href=\"https://space.dingtalk.tech/attachment/html-preview/v1/render?t=EaCPblrqdqh_ZovKelrp7tpPjGv3-E36n7Jnm71B7OM&at_iframe=1#shop-sets\"><em>Shop Sets</em></a><em> to compare curated combinations.</em></p>","open":false}},"faq_5":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How do I choose the right Black Friday bundle?","answer":"<p><em>Start with how the knives will be used: choose a kitchen set for everyday meal prep, an Outdoor & BBQ bundle for outdoor cooking, or a larger collection when you want a more complete gift.</em></p>","open":false}},"faq_6":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Are the products and prices shown on this page final?","answer":"<p><em>The live product page and checkout display the current price, available options, and applicable offers. Please check your cart before completing your order.</em></p>","open":false}},"faq_7":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"What if my order arrives with a quality-related issue?","answer":"<p><em>Please contact our customer support team with your order number and details of the issue. For quality-related issues, HUUSK provides free return or replacement support. Please refer to the Returns Policy for the full process.</em></p>","open":false}},"faq_QaJVeN":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How should I care for my HUUSK knife?","answer":"<p><em>Hand wash and dry the knife promptly after use, then store it safely. Avoid leaving it wet or putting it away while damp. Follow any care instructions supplied with your specific product.</em></p>","open":false}},"faq_m7hyeq":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Where can I find shipping costs and delivery estimates?","answer":"<p><em>Available shipping methods, fees, and estimated delivery times are displayed during checkout. For full details, please review the store’s Shipping Policy.</em></p>","open":false}}},"block_order":["faq_1","faq_2","faq_